8|'return' cannot be used in an iterator: use 'yield return value;' to produce an element and 'yield break;' to finish
11|an iterator \(with 'yield'\) must return IEnumerable<T> or IEnumerator<T> \(not 'int'\)
19|'yield' cannot be used inside a 'finally' block
24|'await' can only be used in an 'async' iterator \(async IAsyncEnumerable<T> F\(\) \{ \.\.\. \}\)
28|an 'async' iterator must return IAsyncEnumerable<T> or IAsyncEnumerator<T> \(not 'IEnumerable<int>'\)
33|an iterator that returns 'IAsyncEnumerable<int>' must be 'async' \(async IAsyncEnumerable<T> F\(\) \{ \.\.\. \}\)
40|cannot implicitly convert type 'int' to 'string'
43|an iterator cannot have 'ref' or 'out' parameters
48|an iterator \(with 'yield'\) must return IEnumerable<T> or IEnumerator<T> \(not 'void'\)
51|'await foreach' can only be used inside an 'async' method or lambda
